{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(input_number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given number is a Woodall number.\n    A number N is a Woodall number if there exists a non-negative integer n such that N = n * 2^n - 1.\"\"\"\n    if input_number < -1:\n        return False\n\n    n = 0\n    while True:\n        woodall_candidate = n * (1 << n) - 1\n\n        if woodall_candidate == input_number:\n            return True\n\n        if woodall_candidate > input_number and n > 0:\n            return False\n\n        if n > 60: # Arbitrary practical upper bound for n\n            return False\n\n        n += 1"}
