{"task_id": "Mbpp/63", "solution": "def max_difference(tuple_list: list[tuple[float | int, float | int]]) -> float | int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum absolute difference between elements in a list of tuples.\n    Returns 0 if the input list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not tuple_list:\n        return 0\n\n    max_diff = 0.0\n\n    for a, b in tuple_list:\n        current_diff = abs(a - b)\n        if current_diff > max_diff:\n            max_diff = current_diff\n\n    return max_diff"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts substrings where the sum of digits equals the substring's length.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # current_substring = input_string[i:j+1]\n            # length_value = len(current_substring)\n            # sum_of_digits = sum(int(digit) for digit in current_substring)\n\n            # Optimization: calculate sum incrementally\n            current_sum += int(input_string[j])\n            length_value = (j - i) + 1\n\n            if current_sum == length_value:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
