{"task_id": "Mbpp/68", "solution": "def is_Monotonic(array: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given array is monotonic.\n    An array with fewer than two elements is considered monotonic.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array) < 2:\n        return True\n\n    is_increasing = True\n    is_decreasing = True\n\n    for i in range(1, len(array)):\n        if array[i] < array[i-1]:\n            is_increasing = False\n        if array[i] > array[i-1]:\n            is_decreasing = False\n\n    return is_increasing or is_decreasing"}
