{"task_id": "Mbpp/75", "solution": "def find_tuples(list_of_tuples: list[tuple[int, ...]], k: int) -> list[tuple[int, ...]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Filters a list of tuples, returning only those where all elements are divisible by k.\n    Raises ValueError if k is zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    if k == 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Divisor 'k' cannot be zero.\")\n\n    def _is_tuple_divisible(tup: tuple[int, ...], k: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if all elements in a given tuple are divisible by k.\"\"\"\n        for element in tup:\n            if element % k != 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    filtered_list = []\n    for tup in list_of_tuples:\n        if _is_tuple_divisible(tup, k):\n            filtered_list.append(tup)\n    return filtered_list"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts a list of comparable elements in ascending order using the Comb Sort algorithm.\n    It returns a new list with the sorted elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_list)\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n\n    arr = input_list[:]\n    gap = n\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        gap = int(gap / shrink_factor)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if arr[i] > arr[i + gap]:\n                arr[i], arr[i + gap] = arr[i + gap], arr[i]\n                swapped = True\n    return arr"}
