{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(stringList: list[str], patternList: list[str]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if stringList follows patternList based on consistent one-to-one mapping.\"\"\"\n    if len(stringList) != len(patternList):\n        return False\n\n    string_to_pattern_map = {}\n    pattern_to_string_map = {}\n\n    for i in range(len(stringList)):\n        s = stringList[i]\n        p = patternList[i]\n\n        # Check mapping from string to pattern\n        if s in string_to_pattern_map:\n            if string_to_pattern_map[s] != p:\n                return False\n        \n        # Check mapping from pattern to string\n        if p in pattern_to_string_map:\n            if pattern_to_string_map[p] != s:\n                return False\n        \n        # Establish new mapping if both are unmapped\n        if s not in string_to_pattern_map and p not in pattern_to_string_map:\n            string_to_pattern_map[s] = p\n            pattern_to_string_map[p] = s\n\n    return True"}
