{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_memo = {}\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth term of the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    It defines P(1)=1 and P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n - P(n-1)) for n > 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 1:\n        _memo[1] = 1\n        return 1\n\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    p_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n    term1_index = p_n_minus_1\n    term2_index = n - p_n_minus_1\n\n    result = sequence(term1_index) + sequence(term2_index)\n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
