{"task_id": "Mbpp/120", "solution": "from typing import List, Tuple, Union\ndef max_product_tuple(data: List[Tuple[Union[int, float], Union[int, float]]]) -> Union[int, float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum absolute product from pairs of numbers within a list of tuples.\n    Raises ValueError if the input list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not data:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input list cannot be empty.\")\n\n    max_abs_product: Union[int, float] = float('-inf')\n\n    for a, b in data:\n        current_product = a * b\n        current_abs_product = abs(current_product)\n        if current_abs_product > max_abs_product:\n            max_abs_product = current_abs_product\n\n    return max_abs_product"}
