{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(numbers: list) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zeroes to non-zeroes in a list of integers, handling edge cases for division by zero.\"\"\"\n    num_zeroes = 0\n    num_non_zeroes = 0\n\n    for num in numbers:\n        if num == 0:\n            num_zeroes += 1\n        else:\n            num_non_zeroes += 1\n\n    if num_non_zeroes == 0:\n        if num_zeroes == 0:\n            return float('nan')  # Empty array (0/0)\n        else:\n            return float('inf')  # Array with only zeroes (N/0, N>0)\n    else:\n        return num_zeroes / num_non_zeroes"}
