{"task_id": "Mbpp/268", "solution": "def find_star_num(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n'th star number by orchestrating helper components.\"\"\"\n\n    class StarNumber:\n        \"\"\"Represents a star number and its corresponding index 'n'.\"\"\"\n        def __init__(self, n_index: int, value: int):\n            self.n_index = n_index\n            self.value = value\n\n    class StarNumberCalculator:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the n'th star number using the formula 6n(n-1) + 1.\"\"\"\n        def find_nth_star_number(self, n: int) -> StarNumber:\n            calculated_value = 6 * n * (n - 1) + 1\n            return StarNumber(n, calculated_value)\n\n    calculator = StarNumberCalculator()\n    star_number_entity = calculator.find_nth_star_number(n)\n    return star_number_entity.value"}
