{"task_id": "Mbpp/296", "solution": "def get_Inv_Count(arr: list[int | float]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the total number of inversions in a given array.\n    An inversion is defined as a pair of elements (arr[i], arr[j]) such that i < j and arr[i] > arr[j].\n    \"\"\"\n    inversion_count = 0\n    n = len(arr)\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if arr[i] > arr[j]:\n                inversion_count += 1\n    return inversion_count"}
