{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "def find_lucas(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the n'th Lucas number based on the sequence L(0)=2, L(1)=1, L(n)=L(n-1)+L(n-2).\n    Uses an iterative approach to find the desired Lucas number.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    \n    a, b = 2, 1 # L(0), L(1)\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return b"}
