{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def _calculate_sum_of_single_number_digits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of digits for a single non-negative integer.\n\n    Args:\n        number: A non-negative integer.\n    Returns:\n        The sum of its individual digits.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n    sum_digits = 0\n    while number > 0:\n        sum_digits += number % 10\n        number //= 10\n    return sum_digits\ndef sum_of_digits(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the total sum of digits for each number in a given list.\n\n    Args:\n        numbers: A list of non-negative integers.\n    Returns:\n        The total sum of digits for all numbers in the list.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for number in numbers:\n        total_sum += _calculate_sum_of_single_number_digits(number)\n    return total_sum"}
