{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given integer.\n    It considers positive factors and handles 0 as a special case.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    factors = []\n    # Iterate up to sqrt(abs(number)) to find all factors efficiently.\n    for i in range(1, int(abs(number)**0.5) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            factors.append(i)\n            if i * i != abs(number):\n                factors.append(abs(number) // i)\n\n    even_factors_sum = 0\n    # Filter for even factors and sum them up.\n    for factor in factors:\n        if factor % 2 == 0:\n            even_factors_sum += factor\n\n    return even_factors_sum"}
