{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within the inclusive range [max(1, l), r].\"\"\"\n    start = max(1, l)\n    current_sum = 0\n\n    if r < start:\n        return 0\n\n    for number in range(start, r + 1):\n        if number % 2 != 0:\n            current_sum += number\n\n    return current_sum"}
