{"task_id": "Mbpp/632", "solution": "def move_zero(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Moves all zero elements to the end of the given list, preserving the relative order of non-zero elements.\n\n    Args:\n        input_list: The list of numbers to be processed.\n\n    Returns:\n        A new list with all zeroes moved to the end.\n    \"\"\"\n    non_zero_elements = []\n    zero_count = 0\n    for element in input_list:\n        if element == 0:\n            zero_count += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_elements.append(element)\n    non_zero_elements.extend([0] * zero_count)\n    return non_zero_elements"}
